{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0594_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c08962dffbe7175c38d4601ca7f5735843129907971abf1873c3ecfa773742b7", "ja": "（ソロ曲を歌い終え、大きな歓声を受けた美也。\n控え室に戻ってきても、まだ嬉しそうだ……）", "zh": "（唱完个人曲、收获了热烈欢呼的美也。\n回到休息室后，看起来还是很开心……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0594_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "c5a2f78db5cfed282b57782bca6358a65711af1c25e4e8409542516580d339e0", "ja": "とっても、素敵なステージになりましたね～。\nなんだかまだ、気持ちがふわふわしていますよ～。", "zh": "成了非常精彩的舞台呢～。\n总觉得心情到现在还轻飘飘的～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0594_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "fd24df8ab08083533d4409c83affc1a6a82a5cd7bd6fe47099e7381b00748557", "ja": "客席のみんながいっしょに歌ってくれて、\n私の色のライトがゆらゆら揺れて……。", "zh": "观众席上的大家和我一起合唱，\n代表我颜色的荧光棒轻轻摇曳着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0594_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "8c92d83d809e155a3fe2ca04ac0cffbf24cc13ac2cb2a443f59590d2217c3074", "ja": "本当に、素敵な景色でした～。\nずっとずっと、忘れられそうにないです～。", "zh": "真的是一幅美好的景色呢～  \n感觉我永远永远都忘不了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0594_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b0e1e49c4d2df6b1f4a52a2f168940c6998051e2246f276429984cae0c7f0f8b", "ja": "美也が楽しそうに歌うから、お客さん達も\n一緒に口ずさみたくなったんだろうな。", "zh": "因为美也唱得那么开心，观众们也想跟着一起哼唱了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0594_1005_p", "source_sha256": "977b5c6977fd7fb4d53d933786e89688ace76a1760636a6ec32db482c376afd7", "ja": "ステージを見ていたスタッフさん達も、\nニコニコしながら歌ってたよ。", "zh": "看着舞台的工作人员们，也都笑眯眯地跟着唱了起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0594_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "20dccd76c5848f2b36882faa320bc52106ed648474a2f6aead479b856480568c", "ja": "そうでしたか～。それはなんだか、\nとってもうれしいですな～。", "zh": "这样啊～那还真是让人特别开心呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0594_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "f06629ee2ab39879e990c34bedbcc904efa40daac4aea37df7bbadc140bd5d93", "ja": "私がこうしてステージに立てているのは、\n応援してくれるファンのみなさんや……。", "zh": "我能站在这个舞台上，\n都是因为一直支持我的各位粉丝……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0594_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "48e68afef5e83f04a9e4809e9b087c1240387c4c72a2a3c1e5e914b1ce060a2d", "ja": "今日のこの日を、素敵なステージにしてくれる、\n大勢のスタッフさんたち……。", "zh": "是众多工作人员让今天成为如此精彩的舞台……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0594_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "ee0214f0b695ec195c88fe0e5c7c93133ef3bce5da5511c0c4a36d16d098cb52", "ja": "それから、大切な仲間と、\n{$P$}さんのおかげですから～。", "zh": "还有，也是多亏了重要的伙伴，以及{$P$}先生哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0594_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b1c2789a031ec7710b0044912e8b047f280c7cfcdbb80bada87bd03149164f6c", "ja": "美也……。", "zh": "美也……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0594_1011_042miy", "source_sha256": "30638a50b238ccdae8cdf7a0dbeea3fe1306b6082c479dac1409267a88d91608", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\n私は、夢に近づけていると思いますか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n您觉得，我有在离梦想越来越近吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0594_1012", "source_sha256": "d7dc2c584dab1c79c1051244bd1990da52c55f4f5fffd94bd0097c76a51bd1ca", "ja": "もちろん！", "zh": "那当然！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0594_2000_p", "source_sha256": "014e0e47b6dbd074855f0befd87dd001b59439c95075d5b9faa846be90020df9", "ja": "見えなくても、ちゃんと近づいていってるはずだ。\n俺も、美也の夢を叶えたいと思ってるよ。", "zh": "就算还看不到，也一定是在一步步靠近的。我也希望能帮美也实现梦想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0594_2001_042miy", "source_sha256": "0b8d764a850e42274b1df44d34c2695bdc9c0c8bd1e3ffdeb98219dba966808a", "ja": "ありがとうございます～。", "zh": "谢谢您～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0594_2002_042miy", "source_sha256": "8dc4fe2126011b1b09af21f1a1811056ab84749effd10ca86a90c99044d98a35", "ja": "近所のおばあちゃんが言ってたんですよ～。\n「地道なお世話が、いずれ綺麗な花になる」って。", "zh": "邻居家的老奶奶曾经对我说过哦～。“一点一滴的照料，终有一天会开出美丽的花朵。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0594_2003_p", "source_sha256": "496b92857de39982829a8afd049d87159681329c0e769553b5725927f5c3942a", "ja": "そうだな。人生、何が起きるかわからないし……。\n日々を積み重ねていれば、いつかは……だな。", "zh": "是啊。人生中会发生什么，谁也说不准……只要日复一日地积累下去，总有一天……吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0594_2004_042miy", "source_sha256": "cdd8242cf479de456e9a869d7315ff7ff535f15a25962cc37d957ed2022df9aa", "ja": "はい～。これからも、一歩一歩、\n夢に向かって進んでいきましょう～。", "zh": "是呀～今后也一步一步地，朝着梦想前进吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0594_2005_p", "source_sha256": "da61854e9dcbe7f3b47ce57bccf7ced80a4627f4a81e4a061a680f285bc41304", "ja": "（いつもの調子で答えた美也だが、その瞳は遥か遠く、\n前だけを見つめている。夢の実現は、疑いないな！）", "zh": "（虽然美也像平时一样回答着，但她的双眸望向遥远的前方，只凝视着前方。她一定能实现梦想！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
